      "content": "it’s just exhausting. like i wake up and i already know it's gonna be the same nothingness. i feel like a fraud pretending to be happy for my family and my partner. they deserve someone who actually feels alive, not this... shell. sometimes i just look at them and think, if i wasn't here, the grayness wouldn't be affecting them. it would just be gone. and everything would be simpler for everyone.",
